-- Normalize product names from ALL-CAPS to smart Title Case.
-- Oil/grade/fluid codes (5W-30, ATF, GT1, PLA, CHF, CVTF, DCTF, FFL, MET, FE,
-- LC, JD, ZX, GSM, SAE, API, SP, SN, SL, LL, HD, EP, RTU, EU, …) stay uppercase;
-- every other word becomes Title Case. Display-only improvement: the name-matching
-- code (invoice-sku-match, sku-analytics) is case/punctuation-insensitive, and the
-- new names have no collisions against the product_name UNIQUE constraint.
-- Each UPDATE is guarded by the prior name, so this migration is idempotent/no-op
-- on re-run and never clobbers a name that has since changed.
-- 228 products renamed (of 230).

